Two clean closed forms for `jacobiTripleSign` (defined in `Chapter19.lean`
via `List.find?` on triangular indices):

* `jacobiTripleSign_triangular`: `jacobiTripleSign (k*(k+1)/2) = (-1)^k * (2k+1)`.
